1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,970
Cinderella

2
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:11,900
Cinderella's Sister

3
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:19,450
Cinderella's Sister

4
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:37,900
Drink it please, I made it myself.

5
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:46,610
Hyo Seon said it tastes the same,

6
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:52,580
but I... Fa...

7
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:58,120
Fa-Fath...

8
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:01,780
Fa-Fath...

9
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:10,690
I wanted to be complimented by my dad.

10
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:16,540
I did wrong.

11
00:01:18,190 --> 00:01:25,050
Please forgive me, Dad.

12
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:29,840
Please forgive me, Dad.

13
00:01:31,470 --> 00:01:33,750
Dad...

14
00:01:39,250 --> 00:01:42,260
Please forgive me, Dad.

15
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:53,140
Forgive me, Dad. I was wrong.

16
00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:56,890
Dad!

17
00:01:56,890 --> 00:02:02,570
Dad... I was wrong.

18
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:08,000
Please forgive me.

19
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:16,220
Dad... Dad. Dad!

20
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:19,430
Dad!

21
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:24,580
I was wrong.

22
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,120
Episode 11

23
00:02:31,770 --> 00:02:38,250
I've done it again, Goo Hyo Seon. This is how large my contributions to Dae Sung are,

24
00:02:38,250 --> 00:02:40,290
but what are you going to do?

25
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:48,990
At this rate, it'll all become mine.

26
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,850
But still, will that be all right with you?

27
00:02:56,160 --> 00:03:00,410
My mom is no ordinary person, and I'm her daughter.

28
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:04,330
There's a chance that I may be worse than my mom.

29
00:03:04,330 --> 00:03:08,790
I'm much smarter than my mom.

30
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:17,490
Don't let anything happen to you. Even if you do, I won't save you.

31
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:20,000
I've warned you.

32
00:04:35,970 --> 00:04:40,170
Noona. Noona!

33
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,780
Why?

34
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:57,780
I'm going somewhere real quick.

35
00:04:57,780 --> 00:04:59,130
Where?

36
00:04:59,130 --> 00:05:03,440
Well...That is...

37
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:07,100
I'm going for Reserve Forces training.

38
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:09,520
- Reserve Forces training?
- Yes.

39
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:14,580
Since there's nothing to do at Do Ga. You don't need me, right?

40
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:16,970
Be safe and come back.

41
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:21,180
Noona! You are so bad.

42
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:25,090
A person is talking to you but, you just turn around and walk away.

43
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:28,480
Come over here and take a look at this bread (brooch).

44
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,080
Bread?

45
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:33,550
- It's bread. Doesn't it look like bread?
- Isn't it a crown?

46
00:05:33,550 --> 00:05:38,150
The person who sold it to me said that's what it was. But, it looks like bread to me.

47
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,210
What about it?

48
00:05:40,210 --> 00:05:43,730
As long as you wear this, you won't starve.

49
00:05:43,730 --> 00:05:45,840
What is this? Don't do it.

50
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:48,440
Please just stay still,

51
00:05:54,730 --> 00:06:00,320
When I'm not here, wear that around..this will protect you,

52
00:06:02,350 --> 00:06:06,610
When you change, make sure you change that too.

53
00:06:06,610 --> 00:06:11,850
If you hang bread on yourself, you'll never starve.

54
00:06:11,860 --> 00:06:14,190
Even all the people around you.

55
00:06:17,130 --> 00:06:19,730
I'm serious.

56
00:06:19,730 --> 00:06:25,410
I've lived my life making sure you won't starve, and you won't believe me?

57
00:06:25,410 --> 00:06:31,670
It's strange, those foolish stubborn words, I want to believe in them,

58
00:06:31,670 --> 00:06:34,510
Believe it.

59
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:39,590
I'll be back. Eat well, and stay healthy.

60
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:28,370
Who will read this now?

61
00:07:29,130 --> 00:07:31,410
I'm not sure.

62
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:34,240
Take it.

63
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:50,220
Aren't you going?

64
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:01,830
Monk...

65
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:09,180
P..pl..please save me, Monk.

66
00:08:50,110 --> 00:08:52,350
Why?

67
00:08:52,350 --> 00:08:57,290
You know where all the ahjusshi's live, right?

68
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,900
What did he say?

69
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:18,820
How poorly did you treat them that they would act like that?

70
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:21,760
- They won't come back?
- Never.

71
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:28,860
- What are you trying to do?
- I have to make the yeast and I need people.

72
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:32,050
You won't succeed.

73
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:36,670
You only see them as people who will make the wine.

74
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:43,490
Did you know that this ahjusshi is our high school classmate Dong Soo's father?

75
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:48,670
- Dong Soo?
- Yeah, Dong Soo.

76
00:09:48,670 --> 00:09:52,480
The Dong Soo who showed up with a bouquet because he liked you.

77
00:09:53,290 --> 00:09:56,860
Do you know that Dong Soo's grandmother is sick?

78
00:09:56,860 --> 00:10:02,460
Ahjusshi always struggled to make ends meet because he had to buy medicine for their grandmother.

79
00:10:02,460 --> 00:10:07,740
Then Dad would intentionally have Dong Soo's dad have extra responsibility

80
00:10:07,740 --> 00:10:14,080
at the factory and at Do Ga, trying to let him earn a bit extra.

81
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,800
I guess you wouldn't know that either.

82
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:21,680
After he quit his job at our place, he must have no source of income.

83
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:25,180
What did you do that would make him say he would never come back?

84
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:28,560
When the ahjusshi's made a mistake,

85
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:32,520
Dad was very strict with them, but there a reason

86
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:38,160
the ahjusshis have worked at our place for over twenty years.

87
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:45,880
You treated the ahjusshi's as if they were cows or horses,

88
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:48,140
not as human.

89
00:10:53,580 --> 00:11:00,460
If you're going to go in there thoughtlessly and try to threaten them to come back again without any measures, then quit.

90
00:11:01,850 --> 00:11:05,430
I'm going to ask my uncle.

91
00:11:05,430 --> 00:11:08,140
Because he's very close to the ahjussis.

92
00:11:09,490 --> 00:11:14,240
If my uncle tries and still can't get them to come back, then we'll have to do it by ourselves.

93
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:17,060
No matter how long it takes,

94
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:20,720
let's just do it by ourselves.

95
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:34,720
Tell me everything.

96
00:11:41,130 --> 00:11:46,870
Mr. Jang's mood gets better if you feed him something sweet.

97
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:53,970
Eon Nyeong's father likes meat. Not pork but beef.

98
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:59,350
Hyo Seon's great-uncle runs an herbal medicine clinic.

99
00:11:59,350 --> 00:12:03,770
Dong Soo's grandmother knew well about your conditions.

100
00:12:05,210 --> 00:12:10,650
I apologize for my behavior the last time.

101
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:27,470
I have something to ask you.

102
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:30,030
Tell me.

103
00:12:30,820 --> 00:12:35,300
What am I to you?

104
00:12:37,050 --> 00:12:39,120
What kind of a question is that?

105
00:12:45,470 --> 00:12:48,320
It's because I'm curious.

106
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:52,820
What am I to you?

107
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:55,860
Why would you ask something like that?

108
00:12:55,860 --> 00:13:01,760
I want to know definitely what you think of me.

109
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:10,240
What do you think of me?

110
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:12,110
By any chance...

111
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:18,270
Are you going to abandon me?

112
00:13:22,140 --> 00:13:26,660
Are you going to work diligently to rebuild the winery as much as you can...

113
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:28,160
And...

114
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:32,470
then leave?

115
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:35,310
Are you worried ...

116
00:13:37,300 --> 00:13:39,200
that I'd leave?

117
00:13:41,730 --> 00:13:44,980
Just answer the question you've been asked

118
00:13:44,980 --> 00:13:48,230
and then ask your question.

119
00:13:50,730 --> 00:13:52,720
Are you leaving?

120
00:13:55,170 --> 00:13:57,890
Clinging to our relationship ...

121
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:01,510
is very tiring.

122
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:09,010
Even if it's just for a moment, can't you pretend to be a close sister to me?

123
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:15,360
Can't you promise me that you won't go anywhere?

124
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:25,610
I've thought about it a lot while standing in Do Ga.

125
00:14:26,890 --> 00:14:28,860
If Do Ga crumbles,

126
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,320
it's the same as Dad crumbling again.

127
00:14:34,490 --> 00:14:36,700
I can't let that happen.

128
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:40,200
There's no way Do Ga can crumble, but

129
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:45,590
I don't know what to do, how to do it, and where to start.

130
00:14:45,590 --> 00:14:50,880
No matter how hard I try to figure out the answers, I can't.

131
00:14:52,070 --> 00:14:55,310
I wish someone would just hug me.

132
00:14:56,890 --> 00:14:59,370
But even Mom has become strange.

133
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:03,230
I'm so lonely.

134
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:09,260
I think that mom is being like that because she's still in shock.

135
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:12,800
And that she'll get better as some time has passed.

136
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:18,420
If I don't think like that, I think I'm going to go insane.

137
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:23,990
Instead of clinging difficulty to you,

138
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:27,630
I want to smile along side you.

139
00:15:28,730 --> 00:15:30,590
Because of you.

140
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:35,650
I would like to feel warm.

141
00:15:41,190 --> 00:15:43,010
Don't cry.

142
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:49,470
Do you think I intentionally made our relationship one so rocky?

143
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:56,320
I'm not the kind of person who intends to do that. You know that.

144
00:15:57,120 --> 00:16:02,170
I can't intentionally make a relationship so rocky because I want to,

145
00:16:02,170 --> 00:16:06,790
nor can I intentionally act kind.

146
00:16:06,790 --> 00:16:08,990
That's just how I'm made.

147
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:11,880
But...

148
00:16:14,820 --> 00:16:16,720
I'll try.

149
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:26,060
I can't be warm towards you. I can't promise that.

150
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:30,790
Because I don't know how to be like that.

151
00:16:30,790 --> 00:16:32,350
But...

152
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:38,520
so that you don't have to feel like you're trying so hard...

153
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:42,960
I'll try to help that.

154
00:16:44,230 --> 00:16:46,460
For a little while.

155
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:50,970
Really?

156
00:16:56,730 --> 00:16:58,590
Don't cry.

157
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:13,760
Don't do this kind of thing.

158
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:34,060
When I told him I had sinned against two girls,

159
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:43,020
The monk just said to bow down without any explanation.

160
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:49,160
Could I be forgiven by bowing?

161
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:57,520
If only I could be, I can continue to bow until I take my last breath.

162
00:17:59,570 --> 00:18:01,410
But...

163
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:18,180
Ahjussi.

164
00:18:21,260 --> 00:18:22,850
Ahjussi.

165
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,720
Please....

166
00:18:29,130 --> 00:18:31,870
Please, open your eyes.

167
00:18:34,050 --> 00:18:36,690
Even at that moment, I put myself first.

168
00:18:36,690 --> 00:18:38,670
Ahjussi.

169
00:18:38,670 --> 00:18:42,450
I begged him to not let me commit this sin.

170
00:18:42,450 --> 00:18:46,590
At that moment, I wasn't even worried about Ahjussi dying.

171
00:18:46,590 --> 00:18:50,180
Please... Please open your eyes.

172
00:18:56,450 --> 00:18:58,070
Ahjussi.

173
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:04,440
But still...

174
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:13,950
It's okay.

175
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:22,270
Oh my goodness. He told me it was okay.

176
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:15,220
How can it be okay?

177
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:21,150
How? How?

178
00:21:01,940 --> 00:21:09,240
♫ In the solicitude which wakes me up ♫

179
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:16,550
♫ when I wake up from an exhausted sleep ♫

180
00:21:16,550 --> 00:21:23,100
♫ because I still remember you smiling ♫

181
00:21:23,100 --> 00:21:28,730
♫ You are the only one who is my person ♫

182
00:21:28,730 --> 00:21:36,070
♫ I am living day after day ♫

183
00:21:36,070 --> 00:21:45,000
♫ In your name when tears appear again, woo ♫

184
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:47,850
♫ I can't bear it ♫

185
00:21:47,850 --> 00:21:52,450
♫ So I can't laugh ♫

186
00:21:52,450 --> 00:22:02,340
♫ I call out your name again ♫

187
00:23:16,810 --> 00:23:18,630
He's back.

188
00:23:22,350 --> 00:23:24,810
He's smiling.

189
00:23:24,810 --> 00:23:26,310
Come here.

190
00:23:33,730 --> 00:23:35,440
I'm back.

191
00:23:38,160 --> 00:23:41,370
I'm back.

192
00:23:41,370 --> 00:23:46,100
That girl that used to cry so much as to tear her insides.

193
00:23:50,150 --> 00:23:52,010
Come here.

194
00:23:55,900 --> 00:23:57,750
Please come here.

195
00:24:01,420 --> 00:24:03,250
Come here.

196
00:24:34,470 --> 00:24:36,280
Eun Jo.

197
00:24:40,600 --> 00:24:42,390
Eun Jo

198
00:24:45,910 --> 00:24:48,390
Now, I really...

199
00:24:50,350 --> 00:24:56,200
I can't go to you.

200
00:25:00,010 --> 00:25:02,240
I just can't go.

201
00:25:05,290 --> 00:25:07,740
I can't go anymore.

202
00:25:10,140 --> 00:25:12,700
I can't go anymore.

203
00:25:14,300 --> 00:25:17,000
But...

204
00:25:18,590 --> 00:25:23,540
If only you allow me, I...

205
00:25:26,300 --> 00:25:28,720
I'll...

206
00:25:30,150 --> 00:25:32,120
For you two...

207
00:25:32,910 --> 00:25:38,660
as if bowing 30 million times, I will look after both of you.

208
00:25:41,130 --> 00:25:43,080
Just like Ahjussi.

209
00:25:46,470 --> 00:25:48,650
In place of Ahjussi.

210
00:25:51,960 --> 00:25:53,500
I never

211
00:25:56,230 --> 00:25:58,990
asked you to come to me.

212
00:26:01,650 --> 00:26:04,340
Because I never asked you to come to me,

213
00:26:05,860 --> 00:26:08,480
I won't ask

214
00:26:11,410 --> 00:26:13,530
why you can't.

215
00:26:15,890 --> 00:26:23,490
I can't understand why you're going to take his place or take care of like he would have,

216
00:26:26,500 --> 00:26:28,650
But, I won't ask.

217
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:31,780
Okay.

218
00:26:33,700 --> 00:26:35,860
Please do that.

219
00:26:37,770 --> 00:26:39,870
I'm fine

220
00:26:41,710 --> 00:26:44,130
but do that for Hyo Seon.

221
00:26:46,600 --> 00:26:49,360
She has so many gaps.

222
00:26:51,870 --> 00:26:54,460
Even as she tears me apart,

223
00:26:57,320 --> 00:27:00,390
she asks me to hug her

224
00:27:00,390 --> 00:27:02,310
like a puppy.

225
00:27:03,700 --> 00:27:08,900
That aggravates me terribly. Really ...

226
00:27:12,600 --> 00:27:17,590
Even though... I don't like her at all,

227
00:27:21,840 --> 00:27:24,390
if I can make her feel warm,

228
00:27:24,390 --> 00:27:27,490
♫  Again today my memory led me astray  ♫

229
00:27:27,490 --> 00:27:34,000
I think I can be forgiven a bit.

230
00:27:36,130 --> 00:27:38,630
If it's possible,

231
00:27:38,630 --> 00:27:42,250
♫  where you can't hold me again  ♫

232
00:27:42,250 --> 00:27:44,570
I'm really going to try to do it.

233
00:27:46,810 --> 00:27:48,370
I really want

234
00:27:48,370 --> 00:27:51,110
♫  Saying I want to see you and hold you again ♫

235
00:27:51,110 --> 00:27:52,880
to be forgiven.

236
00:27:52,880 --> 00:28:00,260
♫  And hold you again while looking at heaven I'm praying  ♫

237
00:28:00,260 --> 00:28:04,280
That's right. Me too.

238
00:28:04,280 --> 00:28:08,060
♫  It must be you  ♫

239
00:28:08,060 --> 00:28:11,450
♫  I cannot be without you  ♫

240
00:28:11,450 --> 00:28:18,410
♫  Like this for another day, month or year  ♫

241
00:28:18,420 --> 00:28:22,080
♫  I don't mind even if I am hurt  ♫

242
00:28:22,080 --> 00:28:26,130
♫  I don't mind even if my heart breaks  ♫

243
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:32,200
On that day, my horrible girl

244
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:36,630
cried for us and me one last time.

245
00:28:36,630 --> 00:28:42,700
♫  because you are the only one I love  ♫

246
00:28:42,700 --> 00:28:48,900
I did as well. As I detached my bad girl off of me

247
00:28:48,900 --> 00:28:52,860
I cried one last time.

248
00:29:13,900 --> 00:29:20,940
Goodness, my chest. Why do I feel so uncomfortable.

249
00:29:32,650 --> 00:29:36,330
Dad. Dad...

250
00:30:43,210 --> 00:30:45,980
This is gross. Move.

251
00:30:49,260 --> 00:30:51,230
Aren't you going to move?

252
00:31:30,430 --> 00:31:33,210
The soup's getting cold. Hurry up and come eat.

253
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:39,220
Why is it only 3 of us?

254
00:31:39,220 --> 00:31:41,130
Then how many should there be?

255
00:31:41,130 --> 00:31:44,920
- What are you talking about?
- Be quiet and eat.

256
00:31:45,940 --> 00:31:48,880
- Eat a lot.
- Mom.

257
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:54,780
I told her to eat alone because I think my chest feeling uncomfortable

258
00:31:54,780 --> 00:31:56,920
if because I've been eating together with her.

259
00:31:58,180 --> 00:32:02,330
What? I cooked this, after sending the kitchen staff away.

260
00:32:02,330 --> 00:32:06,660
She's eating the food I cooked. Am I starving her? I'm just telling her to eat it separately.

261
00:32:06,660 --> 00:32:11,510
Why are you looking at your mother with such horrible eyes? What about this situation can't you stand?

262
00:32:11,510 --> 00:32:15,220
If you don't want to eat, then don't eat.

263
00:32:15,220 --> 00:32:19,910
Joon Soo, go to your sister's room and see if she's there.

264
00:32:21,030 --> 00:32:25,290
Joon Soo. Go and see if your sister is in her room. Okay?

265
00:32:25,290 --> 00:32:27,720
Okay, you evil witch.

266
00:32:28,960 --> 00:32:34,050
No matter how angry you get or glare at it, it'll be no use.

267
00:32:34,050 --> 00:32:36,900
How much more do you want to sin?

268
00:32:38,220 --> 00:32:42,560
Sin? What sin? What sin am I committing?

269
00:32:44,750 --> 00:32:47,160
Goodness, my chest.

270
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:50,940
Why does my chest feel so damn stuffy?

271
00:32:50,940 --> 00:32:53,020
Hey, go and bring me some water.

272
00:32:53,020 --> 00:32:59,020
If I'm reborn again, I feel like I'll be born as Hyo Seon's mom and that thought horrifies me!

273
00:32:59,820 --> 00:33:02,840
- What?
- Since you and I have sinned so much,

274
00:33:02,840 --> 00:33:06,510
we may be punished in the form of being born as Hyo Seon's mom!

275
00:33:07,820 --> 00:33:09,790
Are you going to bring me water?

276
00:33:28,390 --> 00:33:31,050
Please find Hyo Seon and get her to eat breakfast.

277
00:33:31,050 --> 00:33:34,000
Is that so? Where did she go without having breakfast?

278
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:37,340
I don't know. Find her and make sure she eats.

279
00:33:37,340 --> 00:33:40,120
What about you? Did you eat?

280
00:33:40,120 --> 00:33:43,780
Feed her, then bring her to Do Ga.

281
00:33:43,780 --> 00:33:47,920
When someone asks you something learn to not ignore the question and answer them back, you brat.

282
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:51,370
I asked you if you ate, you brat.

283
00:34:04,550 --> 00:34:08,750
You must be hungry, right? The acorn jelly turned out well.

284
00:34:08,750 --> 00:34:11,920
- Eat a lot.
- Enjoy it.

285
00:34:13,590 --> 00:34:17,850
First, leave the loan problem for me to solve.

286
00:34:18,610 --> 00:34:22,120
- How can you?
- Anyway, just leave it to me.

287
00:34:22,120 --> 00:34:25,010
About the repayment deadline, I think we can get an extension.

288
00:34:25,010 --> 00:34:29,580
Even up to just two days ago, the bank said there was no way we could get a loan.

289
00:34:29,610 --> 00:34:33,090
Trust me. There's someone I know.

290
00:34:33,090 --> 00:34:36,690
Because he's hanging on under stipulations I set, there's no strain.

291
00:34:36,690 --> 00:34:37,980
What conditions?

292
00:34:37,980 --> 00:34:44,030
Even more urgent than that is paying back the elders in the family their money.

293
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:48,310
The problem is that they don't want shares but their money immediately.

294
00:34:49,470 --> 00:34:52,110
Hyo Seon, will you try to talk to them again?

295
00:34:53,740 --> 00:34:57,510
Okay. I'll do that, Oppa. I'll go see them tomorrow.

296
00:34:57,510 --> 00:35:01,510
Be sure to talk about Eun Jo... To the elders.

297
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:06,140
Tell them that your smart older sister succeeded in making the yeast that tastes exactly like your father's wine.

298
00:35:06,140 --> 00:35:11,130
That your sister can definitely stand in your father's place.

299
00:35:11,130 --> 00:35:17,070
If not anyone else but you tell them about that, it's possible they could change their minds.

300
00:35:22,610 --> 00:35:27,200
What conditions do you mean? On what conditions did you get an extension?

301
00:35:27,200 --> 00:35:31,210
By any chance, do they want more collateral?

302
00:35:31,210 --> 00:35:35,000
That's not possible at all. There is nothing else to add.

303
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:37,530
Why don't you just leave that to me? Okay?

304
00:35:44,440 --> 00:35:47,840
I'm hungry. Let's eat.

305
00:35:51,420 --> 00:35:56,670
With this... Let's make mixed rice.

306
00:35:59,720 --> 00:36:02,410
- It's going to be delicious.
- Hold this.

307
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:07,160
Should we add... two bowls of rice?

308
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:26,970
Put that away. Without any word, we're just going to do this, right?

309
00:36:35,140 --> 00:36:37,250
This looks delicious.

310
00:36:43,220 --> 00:36:45,910
That's enough. Enough.

311
00:37:02,870 --> 00:37:06,530
Let's go. Hurry up, let's go in.

312
00:37:06,530 --> 00:37:09,600
Come on, everybody. Hurry up, let's all go in.

313
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:13,390
- What do you keep complaining?
- What complaining?
I wasn't either.

314
00:37:13,390 --> 00:37:16,020
- Let's go. Let's all go in.
- Yes, yes.

315
00:37:16,020 --> 00:37:18,930
Let's just forget everything from before.

316
00:37:18,930 --> 00:37:21,340
Yes, you're right.

317
00:37:21,340 --> 00:37:23,280
It's good to be back.

318
00:37:24,510 --> 00:37:28,030
We heard you're going to make the yeast?

319
00:37:28,030 --> 00:37:30,970
What's the problem? Are you not ready to make it again?

320
00:37:30,970 --> 00:37:35,340
This time, what kind will we make? Will we use wheat bran, right? That's better, right?

321
00:37:39,430 --> 00:37:45,220
Wait, I smell sesame oil. Did someone eat mixed rice?

322
00:37:55,170 --> 00:37:57,880
Ahjussis.

323
00:37:57,880 --> 00:38:02,950
Thank you. Thank you.

324
00:38:02,950 --> 00:38:04,640
Uncle, thank you.

325
00:38:06,930 --> 00:38:10,190
Don't think that we were convinced with a few boxes of herbal medicine.

326
00:38:10,190 --> 00:38:13,280
We're not that kind of people.

327
00:38:13,280 --> 00:38:17,690
We're back because you apologized to us. Do you understand?

328
00:38:20,900 --> 00:38:23,900
Okay, okay, okay then. We shouldn't be standing around here like this.

329
00:38:23,900 --> 00:38:27,020
There. Let's take out those curd boxes and do our best to disinfect them.

330
00:38:27,020 --> 00:38:29,290
Let's go. I said to let's go.

331
00:38:29,290 --> 00:38:31,250
- Right, let's go.
- Let's go and get this started.

332
00:38:31,260 --> 00:38:33,180
Let's go.

333
00:38:35,860 --> 00:38:38,960
Here we go.

334
00:39:17,020 --> 00:39:20,610
Oppa, did you go and get the written invocation?

335
00:39:20,610 --> 00:39:24,750
Who will attend the rites now?

336
00:39:27,860 --> 00:39:33,160
Free story

337
00:39:33,160 --> 00:39:36,230
Statement of our conscience! "Dae Seong True Winemakers"

338
00:39:58,330 --> 00:40:02,680
Hello Publisher. This is Hong Gi Jeong.

339
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:05,240
I enjoyed reading your current issue.

340
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:09,270
I enjoyed reading it very much.

341
00:40:22,390 --> 00:40:27,730
What has happened? I can't believe you've actually come all the way into my office.

342
00:40:27,730 --> 00:40:32,950
Gi Hoon knowing the actor behind the fraudulent Japanese exports

343
00:40:32,950 --> 00:40:36,530
is not making an issue of it. What do you think the reason is?

344
00:40:38,720 --> 00:40:42,330
Are you and I on the same side?

345
00:40:42,330 --> 00:40:44,020
No.

346
00:40:44,810 --> 00:40:49,890
I don't think you know, so let me tell you something.

347
00:40:51,830 --> 00:40:55,440
The fact that the successor of Hongju Cooperative, Hong Gi Jeong did it.

348
00:40:56,500 --> 00:41:00,410
And also he is the younger sibling that had a different womb

349
00:41:00,410 --> 00:41:04,540
He cannot bring himself to reveal this fact to the two daughters.

350
00:41:04,540 --> 00:41:10,720
What should be done if Gi Hoon were to hold a legal issue with it in court, I had prepared a strong plan.

351
00:41:10,720 --> 00:41:12,850
It seems to be useless.

352
00:41:13,720 --> 00:41:15,310
Is that what you came here to tell me?

353
00:41:15,310 --> 00:41:18,180
The pretty smart one out of the two daughters

354
00:41:18,180 --> 00:41:22,140
had been featured in an financial magazine and researches yeast strains.

355
00:41:22,140 --> 00:41:25,100
In many ways, she seems to be making an effort.

356
00:41:25,100 --> 00:41:29,210
I don't think the story of the two girls is not what you're really trying to say either.

357
00:41:29,210 --> 00:41:33,770
I also don't think it's sudden you started to have interest in that household's two daughters.

358
00:41:33,770 --> 00:41:35,640
Father...

359
00:41:39,910 --> 00:41:42,520
You're really a bad person.

360
00:41:44,200 --> 00:41:50,960
When Gi Hoon's mother collapsed and fell while running after me,

361
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:55,180
and when I heard later that she died,

362
00:41:55,180 --> 00:41:59,800
You don't know how hard and painful it was for me, do you?

363
00:42:03,290 --> 00:42:09,430
And that... You used that to manipulate Ki Hoon?

364
00:42:09,430 --> 00:42:14,210
I admire you. I will become bad as well.

365
00:42:14,210 --> 00:42:19,880
I'm curious to find out just how much and how bad I can become.

366
00:42:20,930 --> 00:42:22,860
Do you know that?

367
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:46,810
I'm not sure. That's something the President has been doing all his life.

368
00:42:46,810 --> 00:42:49,040
Who is going to take over his place?

369
00:42:59,370 --> 00:43:01,450
Geez.

370
00:43:01,450 --> 00:43:05,430
The role of a mistress of the house, is quite big in these instances.

371
00:43:09,470 --> 00:43:10,980
Hyo Seon.

372
00:43:11,950 --> 00:43:13,350
Yes, Oppa.

373
00:43:13,350 --> 00:43:16,560
Who do you think should read the invocation?

374
00:43:16,560 --> 00:43:18,870
Let's do what you want to do.

375
00:43:21,720 --> 00:43:26,850
If there is anyone among the people gathered here, who can make such a decision instead of the President,

376
00:43:26,850 --> 00:43:30,310
I believe that would be Hyo Seon.

377
00:43:33,340 --> 00:43:39,920
In my opinion it should be the eldest person at the Daeseong True Cooperative like Hyeong-nim Hye Jin

378
00:43:39,920 --> 00:43:44,710
Goodness! Oh no, that makes no sense at all.

379
00:43:44,710 --> 00:43:46,840
How could I dare?

380
00:43:47,680 --> 00:43:51,060
Well, I could if it were absolutely necessary.

381
00:43:51,060 --> 00:43:54,560
or Vice Dept Lead Kim, his best friend

382
00:43:54,560 --> 00:43:56,880
No, no.

383
00:43:56,880 --> 00:44:02,860
Or maybe we can ask one of the elders of the family.

384
00:44:02,860 --> 00:44:06,550
Think about it first, and decide tomorrow, Hyo Seon.

385
00:44:09,760 --> 00:44:13,940
I want to just decide now.

386
00:44:20,810 --> 00:44:26,570
Will you all accept my decision?

387
00:44:34,210 --> 00:44:35,910
Then...

388
00:44:39,040 --> 00:44:41,340
I want Unni to do it.

389
00:44:47,660 --> 00:44:53,200
I want Unni to do the yeast ritual ceremony.

390
00:44:56,110 --> 00:44:58,200
Does that make any sense?

391
00:45:00,160 --> 00:45:02,610
That's really ridiculous.

392
00:45:05,010 --> 00:45:06,720
Please do it for us.

393
00:45:06,720 --> 00:45:11,450
Stop insisting. How could I dare do it?

394
00:45:12,750 --> 00:45:18,490
It's the winery's most important event.

395
00:45:18,490 --> 00:45:21,560
I also think that the same way, Unni.

396
00:45:22,790 --> 00:45:29,280
I can't imagine anyone else other than Dad doing it.

397
00:45:29,280 --> 00:45:31,150
But...

398
00:45:33,510 --> 00:45:38,570
I think Dad would be really happy to see you do it.

399
00:45:42,970 --> 00:45:47,330
It's also hard for me to say this.

400
00:45:50,680 --> 00:45:55,430
Why is it you, but not me?

401
00:45:57,310 --> 00:46:04,660
But if Dad had to pick someone to do the ritual for him,

402
00:46:07,670 --> 00:46:09,940
it would be you, Unni.

403
00:46:12,670 --> 00:46:16,880
So Unni, please do it.

404
00:46:23,880 --> 00:46:28,530
You guys said you would accept my decision, didn't you?

405
00:46:33,620 --> 00:46:36,120
Hyo Seon has made her decision, everyone.

406
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:05,020
The thing is that... I have something to say.

407
00:47:08,230 --> 00:47:13,950
As you know, even though I caused some trouble last time,

408
00:47:13,950 --> 00:47:16,950
this time, the workers...

409
00:47:16,950 --> 00:47:21,350
calling them back in was no easy task.

410
00:47:21,350 --> 00:47:24,750
If not for me, you wouldn't be able to ferment the yeast

411
00:47:24,750 --> 00:47:28,720
or even process it all properly.

412
00:47:28,720 --> 00:47:31,980
Since it was me, I was able to bring them back.

413
00:47:31,980 --> 00:47:35,080
If not for me, there would've been no chance.

414
00:47:35,080 --> 00:47:39,090
What exactly do you want to say to me?

415
00:47:39,830 --> 00:47:43,920
You waited for me to tell me this?

416
00:47:43,920 --> 00:47:47,800
There's nothing else you want to talk to me about?

417
00:47:47,810 --> 00:47:52,140
How can people be so straight-forward?

418
00:47:52,140 --> 00:47:55,630
You have to prepare the story and build up, naturally transitioning into the point-

419
00:47:55,630 --> 00:47:57,810
You've already prepared lots.

420
00:47:58,790 --> 00:48:03,780
Just get straight to the point of your story, I don't have much time.

421
00:48:05,020 --> 00:48:09,210
Your mom keeps telling me to leave.

422
00:48:10,060 --> 00:48:13,130
She told you to leave?

423
00:48:13,130 --> 00:48:17,150
As you know, there's nowhere else I can go if I leave.

424
00:48:17,150 --> 00:48:21,010
I've spent my whole life growing my roots here.

425
00:48:21,010 --> 00:48:26,050
Even if you consider us rocks, I'm the one that's been embedded here, and your mother's the one that rolled in.

426
00:48:26,050 --> 00:48:32,270
No matter how pitiful my circumstances are after my noona passed so suddenly,

427
00:48:32,270 --> 00:48:37,340
- I used to be the prince ...
- I understand. You don't have to leave.

428
00:48:38,570 --> 00:48:41,300
I'll talk to Mom...

429
00:48:42,540 --> 00:48:48,620
I'll talk to her about it, so don't worry. Have a good night.

430
00:48:52,620 --> 00:48:55,290
I already said no! Why are you like this?

431
00:49:01,120 --> 00:49:03,090
What happened?

432
00:49:06,290 --> 00:49:11,250
Mom says her chest feels tight,

433
00:49:11,250 --> 00:49:14,810
so I thought it would be good for her to have some wine.

434
00:49:14,810 --> 00:49:18,980
It eases fatigue and is good for digestion, so...

435
00:49:18,980 --> 00:49:21,920
it's good to drink some to help indigestion.

436
00:49:21,920 --> 00:49:25,180
Get out now! I don't want to see your face!

437
00:49:26,470 --> 00:49:28,350
Hyo Seon, get up.

438
00:49:31,490 --> 00:49:33,670
Get up! Quickly!

439
00:49:35,130 --> 00:49:36,990
Follow me.

440
00:49:53,540 --> 00:49:56,060
MMM

441
00:49:59,400 --> 00:50:04,200
Don't sleep yet. Don't sleep and go out to the pavillion.

442
00:50:04,200 --> 00:50:07,430
I'll send Hyo Seon there in a bit. Comfort her.

443
00:50:07,430 --> 00:50:08,950
What—

444
00:50:17,760 --> 00:50:19,790
Just sit anywhere.

445
00:50:39,140 --> 00:50:43,300
Why do you always get close to Mom? You get hurt every time, so why?

446
00:50:43,300 --> 00:50:46,720
Why are you so obsessed with her?

447
00:50:46,720 --> 00:50:49,070
Don't you know there's something wrong with Mom?

448
00:50:49,070 --> 00:50:52,140
She can't believe that she's become a widow so suddenly,

449
00:50:52,140 --> 00:50:55,820
she's not only acting cold towards you, but everyone in this house!

450
00:50:55,820 --> 00:51:00,540
Just avoid her for a while. Stay away from for a little while.

451
00:51:00,540 --> 00:51:02,430
I...

452
00:51:04,490 --> 00:51:08,430
I can't do that.

453
00:51:08,430 --> 00:51:10,260
What did you say?

454
00:51:10,260 --> 00:51:13,450
I'm always curious about Mom,

455
00:51:15,320 --> 00:51:17,480
and I always miss her.

456
00:51:21,720 --> 00:51:25,460
I keep thinking back to

457
00:51:28,540 --> 00:51:30,990
when Mom pat my head,

458
00:51:32,970 --> 00:51:36,370
when she helped me get a splinter out,

459
00:51:38,960 --> 00:51:42,590
and when she helped me clip my toenails.

460
00:51:47,190 --> 00:51:53,560
Mom is being like this because she's lonely, and I'm lonely too.

461
00:51:53,560 --> 00:51:59,410
So I feel it would be good for us to be together. Even if she hates me for now,

462
00:51:59,410 --> 00:52:04,810
maybe she'll like me again if we see each other often.

463
00:52:09,510 --> 00:52:13,440
Are you an idiot?

464
00:52:15,090 --> 00:52:19,760
Do you think I'm an idiot?

465
00:52:21,670 --> 00:52:26,430
I'm begging you.

466
00:52:27,090 --> 00:52:30,160
Avoid Mom for now.

467
00:52:30,160 --> 00:52:32,620
Eat breakfast with me at the winery,

468
00:52:32,620 --> 00:52:36,760
and work till late with me until Mom is asleep.

469
00:52:36,760 --> 00:52:42,460
If you hide from her like this for a bit, things may get better soon.

470
00:52:44,080 --> 00:52:49,200
Things may get better soon?

471
00:52:53,900 --> 00:52:55,470
Yes.

472
00:52:59,990 --> 00:53:05,040
Do you think I'm a child?

473
00:53:13,840 --> 00:53:19,170
At some point, I also

474
00:53:20,750 --> 00:53:22,640
understood a little.

475
00:53:24,860 --> 00:53:30,530
I knew that Mom treated me differently

476
00:53:33,200 --> 00:53:35,520
when Dad wasn't watching.

477
00:53:37,190 --> 00:53:38,960
I knew it,

478
00:53:40,590 --> 00:53:43,060
but it didn't matter to me.

479
00:53:44,840 --> 00:53:47,930
As much as I was sad about Mom doing that,

480
00:53:49,090 --> 00:53:54,660
I liked her just as much.

481
00:53:59,730 --> 00:54:02,220
As long as I like her,

482
00:54:04,630 --> 00:54:06,900
it doesn't matter.

483
00:54:08,510 --> 00:54:13,570
It doesn't matter. Because I like your mother.

484
00:54:16,630 --> 00:54:21,890
You said things will get better if I hide for a while?

485
00:54:26,730 --> 00:54:29,290
It's okay if things don't get better.

486
00:54:31,600 --> 00:54:36,980
It's okay if I'm despised forever.

487
00:54:39,140 --> 00:54:45,900
As long as I'm not kicked out, or you and Mom don't run off,

488
00:54:48,690 --> 00:54:50,660
I'll be okay.

489
00:54:58,250 --> 00:55:01,650
Without you, Mom and Joon Soo,

490
00:55:02,960 --> 00:55:05,580
I'll be alone.

491
00:55:21,530 --> 00:55:26,920
Just don't abandon me.

492
00:55:28,140 --> 00:55:30,360
Don't give up on me.

493
00:55:32,210 --> 00:55:35,410
If you can do that, I'll be grateful.

494
00:57:02,280 --> 00:57:06,600
I'm begging you. Please treat Hyo Seon well, Mom.

495
00:57:19,070 --> 00:57:23,360
That useless girl, Hyo Seon told you to come tell me this?

496
00:57:23,370 --> 00:57:25,340
To tell me to treat her well?

497
00:57:27,340 --> 00:57:31,710
It makes me shudder thinking about how I fawned over her for eight years.

498
00:57:31,710 --> 00:57:35,170
Now what is she saying? Treat her well?

499
00:57:35,170 --> 00:57:39,600
How am I supposed to treat her well? Should I be her hands and feet?

500
00:57:39,600 --> 00:57:44,480
You little wretch. I was never even your hands and feet.

501
00:57:44,480 --> 00:57:47,130
Do I act as Joon Soo's hands and feet?

502
00:57:47,130 --> 00:57:54,370
You and I... it wouldn't be enough if we bowed at Hyo Seon's feet every single day.

503
00:57:54,370 --> 00:57:57,160
What? Do what, where?

504
00:57:57,160 --> 00:58:01,390
Hyo Seon is like her father.

505
00:58:01,390 --> 00:58:05,810
Do you really think Hyo Seon's father didn't know anything?

506
00:58:05,820 --> 00:58:10,500
The fact that you didn't truly like him, that you wouldn't be with him

507
00:58:10,500 --> 00:58:13,520
if he had nothing that you were after,

508
00:58:13,520 --> 00:58:18,480
That you were acting slick like the tongue in your mouth was an act.

509
00:58:18,480 --> 00:58:20,580
You think he didn't know at all?

510
00:58:20,580 --> 00:58:22,610
You think Hyo Seon's father didn't know?

511
00:58:24,250 --> 00:58:26,330
He knew it all.

512
00:58:27,090 --> 00:58:31,500
Even so, he loved you.

513
00:58:33,410 --> 00:58:38,020
It wouldn't be enough even if you were thrown into hell, Mom.

514
00:58:38,740 --> 00:58:40,760
Hyo Seon's father loved someone like that.

515
00:58:40,760 --> 00:58:44,010
When are you going to finish mumbling?

516
00:58:44,010 --> 00:58:47,240
Just like her father,

517
00:58:47,240 --> 00:58:50,790
Hyo Seon said it's okay even if you don't love her.

518
00:58:50,790 --> 00:58:55,110
She doesn't care as long as she loves you.

519
00:58:55,110 --> 00:58:58,940
Mom, where can you find a father like that?

520
00:58:59,910 --> 00:59:02,150
Where can you find a daughter like that?

521
00:59:02,150 --> 00:59:06,820
Mom, where else can you find people like that in this world?

522
00:59:06,820 --> 00:59:11,470
Exactly. How could there be such stupid people in this world?

523
00:59:11,470 --> 00:59:15,350
Mom! Mom!

524
00:59:15,370 --> 00:59:18,050
We can't be like this!

525
00:59:18,050 --> 00:59:21,060
We aren't humans if we do this!

526
00:59:21,060 --> 00:59:24,750
Mom, have a change of heart please!

527
00:59:24,750 --> 00:59:26,730
If we go on like this,

528
00:59:26,730 --> 00:59:30,690
I feel like we'll get struck by lightning anytime, even if we're just walking on the streets.

529
00:59:31,800 --> 00:59:35,120
Why would we get struck by lightning? What did we do wrong?

530
00:59:35,120 --> 00:59:37,940
How can things get worse from here? Why would we get struck by lightning now?

531
00:59:37,940 --> 00:59:41,940
They made me a widow! What right do they have to strike me with lightning?

532
00:59:41,940 --> 00:59:45,790
Why should I be struck by lightning? Why should I be punished again?

533
00:59:51,470 --> 00:59:56,990
If she goes somewhere and we marry her off, I've done all I needed to so I'm tolerating it.

534
00:59:56,990 --> 01:00:01,580
If she doesn't want to see me, tell her to just marry herself off to some guy! Got it?

535
01:00:02,840 --> 01:00:06,500
I wish someone had steamed her like bossam that bitch.

536
01:00:20,230 --> 01:00:21,360
What are you doing?

537
01:00:21,360 --> 01:00:24,890
Let's go. We can't be like this.

538
01:00:24,890 --> 01:00:28,890
We are jinxes to this family.

539
01:00:28,890 --> 01:00:31,890
Wherever we go, we are jinxes.

540
01:00:31,930 --> 01:00:35,640
We'll end up causing a fire somewhere.

541
01:00:35,640 --> 01:00:40,520
We can't do this to this family. We can't stay here.

542
01:00:41,160 --> 01:00:43,600
Let's pack our things.

543
01:00:46,760 --> 01:00:49,950
- Get yourself together, you brat!
- I said to pack up!

544
01:00:49,950 --> 01:00:51,720
Why should we go?

545
01:00:51,720 --> 01:00:56,470
You, me and Joon Soo together is three times more than what Hyo Seon will inherit.

546
01:00:56,470 --> 01:01:00,410
Even though the business is in ruins, there should be something left after everything is settled.

547
01:01:00,410 --> 01:01:02,810
After I get what I want, I'll leave on my own even if you don't insist on it.

548
01:01:02,810 --> 01:01:07,770
Come to your senses, and try to get as much of it as you can.

549
01:01:07,770 --> 01:01:11,220
Let go of my hand.

550
01:01:11,220 --> 01:01:14,540
Listen up. Be smart, you brat.

551
01:01:14,540 --> 01:01:19,800
Now that things have come to this, we have to get ready for what's to come.

552
01:01:19,800 --> 01:01:24,250
Let go of my hand! Let go!

553
01:01:24,250 --> 01:01:27,070
Has this brat lost her mind? Huh?

554
01:01:34,630 --> 01:01:37,690
Get yourself together, got it?!

555
01:02:04,750 --> 01:02:06,550
What happened?

556
01:02:09,210 --> 01:02:10,850
What's wrong?

557
01:02:12,960 --> 01:02:14,860
What's wrong?

558
01:02:14,860 --> 01:02:16,940
Can you...

559
01:02:19,510 --> 01:02:25,120
Can you take me and run away somewhere?

560
01:02:26,690 --> 01:02:30,260
It's okay if I can't be forgiven.

561
01:02:31,220 --> 01:02:35,190
No. I won't accept any forgiveness.

562
01:02:35,910 --> 01:02:42,410
So... let's run away. Run away with me.

563
01:02:43,200 --> 01:02:45,960
Let's run away!

564
01:02:54,310 --> 01:03:01,370
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

565
01:03:01,370 --> 01:03:09,490
♫ I don't mind even if I am hurt.
I don't mind even if my heart breaks ♫

566
01:03:09,490 --> 01:03:14,660
Do you not know what kind of person I am? Do I look like a pushover to you? Didn't I say not to get close to me?

567
01:03:16,110 --> 01:03:21,550
I really miss Dad. I miss him to death.

568
01:03:22,950 --> 01:03:24,450
Noona.

569
01:03:24,470 --> 01:03:27,640
Before Father can tell them, I'll tell them myself and end it.

570
01:03:27,640 --> 01:03:31,020
Eun Jo!

571
01:03:31,020 --> 01:03:36,270
♫ Can't you hear my voice? ♫
